<Page social="0">[Urgent Letter]&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;PCNAME&gt;!&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Do you remember how the argons kept appearing in Baldera from time to time?&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;They would suddenly appear and then just disappear again. I have finally been able to find out what they're up to.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Please come to Balderon as quickly as possible. I could really use your help.</Page>
