<Page social="4" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;PCNAME&gt;, you and I have seen firsthand that the Argons can never be defeated, but I at least hoped we had them contained.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;But this latest atrocity must not...they dare...they DARE to mutilate the body of a god! This is an outrage I cannot forgive—or forget.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;You must bring me some of their new weapons. Bring them to me, and I will help you forge weapons and armor more powerful than any mortal smith can imagine.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Defeat Krakatox and Thalweg in The Abscess, &lt;PCNAME&gt;, and bring me an Argon Weapon and an Argon Core.</Page>
<Page social="4" voiceTypeId="0">Take this Mahtnan equipment, &lt;PCNAME&gt;. For now it is only the beginning.&lt;BR&gt;Temper it in battle, and it will reveal its true strength. Arborea is counting on you.</Page>
<Page social="4" voiceTypeId="0">You came, &lt;PCNAME&gt;. Before Barak left, he brought back ore from the rift between the worlds. The smiths of the Highwatch call it Mahtnan.&lt;BR&gt;They forged equipment for you from it, but the metal is still asleep — the gear is incomplete. It will awaken only in battle, together with its owner.</Page>
