<Page social="0">Within Kelsaik.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Even though the Azart have resurrected him with Argon power, some portion of his former life as the god Sikander must remain.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Engage him in battle, and bring back a Primal Ember formed from his essense.</Page>
