<Page social="1" voiceTypeId="0">Здравствуй, Хранитель! Каждый день приносит нам новые испытания! Помоги героям Арбореи победить врагов и получи за это ценные награды! &lt;NEXTPAGEBUTTON&gt;"Хорошо."&lt;/NEXTPAGEBUTTON&gt;</Page>
<Page social="4" voiceTypeId="0">&lt;PCNAME&gt;, you and I have seen firsthand that the Argons can never be defeated, but I at least hoped we had them contained.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;But this latest atrocity must not...they dare...they DARE to mutilate the body of a god! This is an outrage I cannot forgive—or forget.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;You must bring me some of their new weapons. Bring them to me, and I will help you forge weapons and armor more powerful than any mortal smith can imagine.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Return to Exodor, &lt;PCNAME&gt;, and be my sword again.</Page>
